Read `DESIGN.md`, `TASTE.md`, `docs/UI-AVATAR.md` and the relevant surface documentation before editing UI.

The OSCAR design direction is **Quietly Alive**: minimal, technical, tactile and expressive. Keep one dominant focal idea per screen. Use OSCAR blue/yellow identity sparingly, let the avatar carry character, prefer native controls and progressive disclosure, and drive motion from real state.

Reject generic AI SaaS patterns: dashboard/card walls, permanent chat sidebars, glassmorphism, neon HUDs, purple gradients, fake telemetry, sparkle-as-AI iconography and random ambient animation.

Visually verify the shipped device classes/viewport targets and respect reduced motion.
